WEBVTT

08:30.503 --> 08:32.043
<b>I told you, didya forget?</b>

08:32.213 --> 08:33.963
<b>But you had to
get involved with me.</b>

08:34.423 --> 08:37.423
<b>What, Rago?
You gonna lecture me too?</b>

08:37.753 --> 08:39.343
